{
  "note": "Hand-written (phase 4 design, docs/design/phase-4/forms.md 7.2). Small made-up resolved definitions, and for each interpreter function (forms.md 7.1) its cases: a case names a definition and gives the function's other inputs and the exact output. Each expected value is worked out from the design, cited in the case's name or its why. packages/forms/src/interp and apps/mobile/lib/forms must give every answer; the readers are packages/forms/test/conformance.test.ts and apps/mobile/test/forms/conformance_test.dart. Every definition passes validate(), with the other definitions of this file as the note types it may name. Answers are a flat map of path to value (forms.md 2.3). An entry ID is e and seven characters from a-z0-9; an entryAt is a UTC time written YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS, then optionally a dot and one to nine digits, then Z.",
